### Welcome to SEDS Yarl

SEDS Yarl is the official chapter of SEDS Sri Lanka at the University of Jaffna (UOJ), representing the Northern Province. Formed by enthusiastic students across the Faculty of Engineering (Ariviyal Nagar, Kilinochchi) and Faculty of Science (Thirunelvely, Jaffna), our chapter promotes space science, astronomy, and aerospace innovation.

### What We Do

SEDS Yarl provides an active, inclusive hub for students to collaborate and learn:

- **Northern Astronomy and Stargazing Nights**: Hosting open-sky telescope observation sessions across Jaffna and Kilinochchi to introduce students and the public to celestial wonders.
- **Hands-On Electronics and CanSat Builds**: Assembling mini sensor modules with temperature, altitude, and radio transceivers to understand satellite subsystems.
- **STEM Outreach in Northern Schools**: Visiting schools in Jaffna, Kilinochchi, Mullaitivu, and Vavuniya to run interactive space workshops, water-rocket launches, and astronomy quizzes.
- **Technical Study Groups**: Organizing weekly peer-learning sessions on Arduino prototyping, Python programming, and orbital mechanics fundamentals.

### Join SEDS Yarl

All students of the University of Jaffna are warmly welcome to join SEDS Yarl.

- **Campus Locations**: Thirunelvely (Jaffna) and Ariviyal Nagar (Kilinochchi).
- **Email**: [sedsyarl@sedssl.org](mailto:sedsyarl@sedssl.org)
